    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/c835a6e3-4ec1-44ed-af5e-af4996b86232.png\" style=\"width:1.67986in;height:0.77361in\" /> which is same as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is tautology because <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is subset of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/bae2ca00-ec34-448f-9bd3-6428553dc37d.png\" style=\"width:1.72014in;height:0.81319in\" /> which is same as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0d6619d5-e28b-4306-9b92-53e9e71238fa.png\" style=\"width:1.76042in;height:0.83333in\" /> which is same as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math>",
